Contact OCRA ÉIREANN
The Obstacle Course Racing Association of Ireland (OCRA ÉIREANN) welcomes enquiries from athletes, clubs, coaches, Technical Officials, race organisers, volunteers, partners and anyone interested in getting involved in obstacle sport.
You can contact OCRA using the form below.
To help us direct your enquiry to the right person, please select the most relevant enquiry type when completing the form.
